		{
			"id":"card-0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Scheduler 1\n\nRuns nightly at `02:00`.\n\n- reads from the queue\n- writes to the index\n\nFails when the upstream is slow.",
			"x":40,
			"y":60,
			"width":300,
			"height":172,
			"linen":{"word":"Works"}
		},
		{
			"id":"card-1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Exporter 2\n\nRetries twice, then gives up and logs the failure.\n\nUses the shared database pool.",
